-Converting Enzyme Inhibitors","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Tetrazoles","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Neprilysin","registryNumber":"EC 3.4.24.11"},{"name":"Natriuretic Peptide, Brain","registryNumber":"114471-18-0"},{"name":"Angiotensin Receptor Antagonists","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Aminobutyrates","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Enalapril","registryNumber":"69PN84IO1A"},{"name":"valsartan","registryNumber":"80M03YXJ7I"},{"name":"sacubitril and valsartan sodium hydrate drug combination","registryNumber":"WB8FT61183"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1812851"}]},"commentCorrectionList":{"commentCorrection":[{"source":"MED","id":"30482916","reference":"Nat Rev Cardiol. 2019 Jan;16(1):4. doi: 10.1038/s41569-018-0134-5","type":"Comment in","orderIn":1},{"source":"MED","id":"30726696","reference":"N Engl J Med. 2019 Feb 7;380(6):590-591. doi: 10.1056/NEJMe1900139","type":"Comment in","orderIn":2},{"source":"MED","id":"30767714","reference":"N Engl J Med. 2019 Mar 14;380(11):1090. doi: 10.1056/NEJMx190009","type":"Erratum in","orderIn":3}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"N","inPMC":"N","citedByCount":932,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"Y","hasData":"Y","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"Y","tmAccessionTypeList":{"accessionType":["nct"]},"dateOfCompletion":"2019-02-25","dateOfCreation":"2018-11-13","dateOfRevision":"2022-04-08","electronicPublicationDate":"2018-11-11","firstPublicationDate":"2018-11-11","firstIndexDate":"2018-11-12","hasEvaluations":"N"}]}}